 (10816,36952,'null','Incidente Grave','23/12/2019','17:17:00','The Aircraft took off from Hong Kong International Airport at 8:17 HKT (UTC+8hrs) on December 23. 2019. and while approaching New Chitose Airport. a series of malfunctions occurred in the generators on the left and right engines. then all the displays in the cockpit disappeared. The aircraft continued to fly and landed at the airport at 12:27 JST (UTC+9hrs). This event falls under the case of “ Failures of more than one system in a redundancy system mandatory for flight guidance and navigation”. and is classified as a serious incident.','Aproximação','Nenhum','****','****','FALSO','Voo Privado'),
